{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35163","headline":"诗品二十四则 悲慨 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 悲慨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大风卷水，林木爲摧。\n意苦若死，招憩不来。\n百岁如流，富贵冷灰。\n大道日往，若爲雄才。\n壮士拂劒，浩然弥哀。\n萧萧落叶，漏雨苍苔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}